From: Dong Chenchen <superdcc97@163.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 20:47:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/30] fork: cache mm rss_stat percpu backing

Adapted from linux 7.0-rc1 patch to OLK-6.6.
- Added percpu_counter_alloc_many_backing, percpu_counter_init_many_from_backing,
  percpu_counter_detach_many, percpu_counter_free_many_backing APIs
- Added NUMA-local mm_rss_stat backing cache to avoid percpu allocation on fork
- Wired mm_rss_stat_init/mm_rss_stat_destroy into mm_init/__mmdrop paths

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
